```text
13. The carcass of a dead chicken must be disposed of in accordance with
Section 6.08.130 of this Chapter.
14. This ordinance does not exempt any person from compliance with the
provisions of Title 6 of the Cheyenne city code. This section shall be
enforced pursuant to section 6.04.040 of this title.
K.
The city/county health officer may issue an order prohibiting the keeping of any
animals, fowl or bird which poses a health hazard to the general public pursuant
to city ordinances, or state and federal laws pertaining to public health.
Section 2.
That this ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon its passage and
publication.
